  "you_need_to": [
    "Mentat is now one repository: https://github.com/lipi4242/mentat. Fetch the 0.5.0 tools from https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lipi4242/mentat/v0.5.0/ (the old addresses keep serving 0.4.x only).",
    "If you use the engine: clone once with git clone --depth 1 --branch v0.5.0 https://github.com/lipi4242/mentat ~/src/mentat, re-sync with ~/src/mentat/engine/sync-to.sh <your-repo> (add the packs you use), then python3 -m anytime_engine.selftest. The old ~/src/anytime-engine clone is no longer used.",
    "If you wrote your own concern pack, widen its ANYTIME_PLUGIN engine range to include 0.5 (for example \">=0.4,<0.6\") first: the 0.5 engine refuses a pack whose range stops at 0.5.",
    "If you run the fleet: update the checkout to ~/src/mentat and run fleet upgrade <repo>; it replaces the fleet@fleet-leader plugin with fleet@mentat (claude plugin marketplace add lipi4242/mentat)."
  ],
